1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,674
Zara: I ordered a pizza. I did NOT order
that.

2
00:00:03,344 --> 00:00:08,664
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: Attention, residents. This is The
Last Floor. Part one of three: the lobby.

3
00:00:09,334 --> 00:00:10,664
Zara: Nope. Nope. Nope.

4
00:00:11,334 --> 00:00:12,835
Bell: Zara! Behind me!

5
00:00:13,505 --> 00:00:16,771
Bell: Elevators beep and open. Zombies
love that.

6
00:00:17,441 --> 00:00:20,661
Bell: Evac helicopter. Roof. Six a.m.

7
00:00:21,331 --> 00:00:23,441
Zara: Twelve floors. In the dark.

8
00:00:23,561 --> 00:00:24,749
Bell: Then we start now.

9
00:00:25,419 --> 00:00:29,055
Bell: Zombies hate stairs. No hands for
the rail.

10
00:00:29,725 --> 00:00:31,807
Zara: Floor two. Every door is open.

11
00:00:32,477 --> 00:00:34,103
Bell: Close them. One by one.

12
00:00:34,773 --> 00:00:36,486
Omar: Don't hurt me! I'm a chef!

13
00:00:37,156 --> 00:00:38,306
Omar: I brought my pan.

14
00:00:38,426 --> 00:00:39,810
Zara: A pan is not a plan.

15
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,269
Omar: Also, meet Pip. Mrs. Lin's parrot.

16
00:00:43,939 --> 00:00:45,069
Pip: Open the door! Open the door!

17
00:00:45,189 --> 00:00:47,255
Bell: Pip. Not that sentence.

18
00:00:47,925 --> 00:00:49,354
Zara: Something is climbing after us.

19
00:00:50,024 --> 00:00:55,779
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: Part one of three, The
Last Floor. Next: the stairs. Follow for part two.

